{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_087_attention_u_net-title\">Attention U-Net</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">由粗尺度 decoder gating signal 计算空间 attention coefficients，在拼接前逐位置筛选 encoder skip。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Computes spatial soft-attention coefficients α ∈ [0,1] from coarse decoder gating signals to filter encoder skips prior to concatenation.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">医学图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D or 3D medical image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">经空间注意力门筛选 skip features 的分割图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Segmentation map decoded from spatially gated skip connections</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=Skft7cijM\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Attention U-Net original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/a434fd585a879e119bed.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_087_attention_u_net\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_087_attention_u_net\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">进入标准 U-Net encoder</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d or 3d medical image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"进入标准 U-Net encoder\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d or 3d medical image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">进入标准 U-Net encoder</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d or 3d medical image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"高分辨率浅层特征，含目标边界与大量背景\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Encoder skip x_l to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Encoder skip x_l\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder skip x_l\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Encoder skip x_l</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">高分辨率浅层特征，含目标边界与大量背景</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Encoder skip x_l to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"较粗尺度深层语义信号，为注意力提供目标上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Decoder gate g within the core gated skip unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Decoder gate g\" data-node-name-en=\"Decoder gate g\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Decoder gate g</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">较粗尺度深层语义信号，为注意力提供目标上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Decoder gate g within the core gated skip unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1 投影 x_l 与 g，对齐后相加、ReLU，再经 psi 计算 logits\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs attention within the core gated skip unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"加性注意力\" data-node-name-en=\"attention\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">加性注意力</span><span class=\"lang-en\">attention</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1 投影 x_l 与 g，对齐后相加、ReLU，再经 psi 计算 logits</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs attention within the core gated skip unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"sigmoid 得到逐位置软门，通常在通道间共享\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs spatial alpha within the core gated skip unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"空间系数 alpha\" data-node-name-en=\"spatial alpha\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">空间系数 alpha</span><span class=\"lang-en\">spatial alpha</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">sigmoid 得到逐位置软门，通常在通道间共享</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs spatial alpha within the core gated skip unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"x_hat_l=alpha⊙x_l，抑制与目标无关的背景响应\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs skip within the core gated skip unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"门控 skip\" data-node-name-en=\"skip\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">门控 skip</span><span class=\"lang-en\">skip</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">x_hat_l=alpha⊙x_l，抑制与目标无关的背景响应</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs skip within the core gated skip unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将 gated skip 与上采样 decoder feature 拼接并卷积\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Decoder fusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Decoder 融合\" data-node-name-en=\"Decoder fusion\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Decoder 融合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Decoder fusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将 gated skip 与上采样 decoder feature 拼接并卷积</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Decoder fusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全分辨率类别概率图\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces segmentation map decoded from spatially gated skip connections via Segmentation Output.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"分割输出\" data-node-name-en=\"Segmentation Output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_087_attention_u_net', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">分割输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Segmentation Output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全分辨率类别概率图</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces segmentation map decoded from spatially gated skip connections via Segmentation Output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Attention U-Net Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · decoder 条件化的空间注意力门</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Additive Decoder-Conditioned Spatial Attention Gate</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Attention U-Net：核心公式 · decoder 条件化的空间注意力门\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"87\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.166097pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.703264 -69.00913 206.997657 11.166097\" width=\"206.997657pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.610385 10.40184C1.528515 9.181013 1.369708 6.888241 1.369708 5.052039S1.40941 1.012393 2.610385-.357315L2.49128-.555824C2.01486-.158807 .496271 1.766725 .496271 5.052039S2.01486 10.213257 2.49128 10.610274L2.610385 10.40184Z\" id=\"m087_g4-0\"></path><path d=\"M.297763 10.40184L.416868 10.610274C.893288 10.213257 2.411877 8.337353 2.411877 5.052039S.893288-.158807 .416868-.555824L.297763-.357315C1.498738 1.012393 1.53844 3.215836 1.53844 5.052039S1.379633 9.181013 .297763 10.40184Z\" id=\"m087_g4-1\"></path><path d=\"M5.697191-3.275389V-3.831212H.615376V-3.275389H5.697191ZM5.697191-1.260528V-1.816352H.615376V-1.260528H5.697191Z\" id=\"m087_g1-61\"></path><path d=\"M8.99243-6.322492V-6.481299H7.